WEBVTT

00:00:02.172 --> 00:00:03.583
i- GALIT

00:00:07.099 --> 00:00:08.274
f-

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.961
finef un tsvantsik.

00:00:11.335 --> 00:00:12.780
un vos makht zi?

00:00:12.432 --> 00:00:14.690
zi iz geven in KEVA biz itstert.

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.402
zi iz aroys fun KEVA

00:00:16.402 --> 00:00:17.912
vayl zi vil lernen

00:00:17.912 --> 00:00:19.614
arbet zi i zi lernt.

00:00:20.413 --> 00:00:21.976
un nokh GALIT?

00:00:21.477 --> 00:00:22.584
MIRA.

00:00:22.168 --> 00:00:24.592
MIRA. vos, vi alt iz MIRA?

00:00:24.902 --> 00:00:27.427
mit a yor klener fun der groyser.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:28.372
un vos makht zi?

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:30.633
zi arbet bay eroport.

00:00:31.737 --> 00:00:34.228
i, i zi arbet, i zi lernt.

00:00:35.128 --> 00:00:36.961
dernokh iz do

00:00:37.693 --> 00:00:38.750
GAI.

00:00:39.162 --> 00:00:40.641
er iz in TSAVA.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.171
er arbet baym, ⟨vu⟩ di shif.

00:00:44.713 --> 00:00:46.107
un nokh GAI?

00:00:46.232 --> 00:00:47.610
un di kleyne

00:00:51.025 --> 00:00:51.947
ikh farge-

00:00:52.257 --> 00:00:53.685
ver iz di kleyne?

00:00:58.045 --> 00:01:00.233
ver iz di kleyne UNK?

00:01:02.398 --> 00:01:04.687
UNK ikh farges.

00:01:05.419 --> 00:01:06.999
un vos makht zi?

00:01:07.377 --> 00:01:08.285
zi?

00:01:08.285 --> 00:01:10.425
ar- di muter arbet oykhet.

00:01:11.595 --> 00:01:13.124
vos makht ROTEM?

00:01:13.249 --> 00:01:16.297
ROTEM iz nokh ⟨in⟩ shule. zi lernt nokh.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:20.482
un vu voynen zey?

00:01:22.902 --> 00:01:24.600
in a, in a shule.

00:01:24.468 --> 00:01:26.254
nisht vayt fun danet?

00:01:26.479 --> 00:01:28.025
far BEER SHEVA.

00:01:30.141 --> 00:01:32.868
un dos iz Shrage's kinder?

00:01:32.773 --> 00:01:33.762
yo.

00:01:34.157 --> 00:01:35.096
un

00:01:34.984 --> 00:01:36.651
der tokhter's kinder

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.538
yo, di tokhter iz SHOSHANA.

00:01:36.651 --> 00:01:38.184
iz do dray.

00:01:38.427 --> 00:01:39.535
ANAT

00:01:42.156 --> 00:01:43.280
MIKA

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:45.441
URI.

00:01:46.273 --> 00:01:48.599
un vos makhn di kinder?

00:01:48.599 --> 00:01:49.693
vos makh-

00:01:49.294 --> 00:01:54.350
zi arbet in a KIBUTS bay a kranker froy, hot gelernt in derinen.

00:01:54.424 --> 00:01:55.666
METAPELET.

00:01:58.373 --> 00:01:59.700
un di kinder?

00:02:00.313 --> 00:02:01.674
di kinder lernen.

00:02:02.271 --> 00:02:04.138
dos yingl iz in der TSAVA.

00:02:12.295 --> 00:02:13.335
un

00:02:15.788 --> 00:02:19.072
ir treft zikh a l- a sakh, di gantse mishpokhe?

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:19.697
vi azoy?

00:02:19.197 --> 00:02:22.397
ir treft zikh a sakh, di mishpokhe?

00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:22.532
yo.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.126
fun

00:02:26.487 --> 00:02:29.198
SHOSHANA's kinder, un SH-

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:31.171
un fun UNK SHRAGE's kinder.

00:02:36.949 --> 00:02:41.651
s'iz do epes nokh az ikh hob dir nisht gefregt, un du host gevolt zogn?

00:02:41.691 --> 00:02:43.305
ikh hob nit UNK farshtanen.

00:02:43.412 --> 00:02:48.924
s'iz, tsi s'iz do nokh epes az ikh hob nisht gefregn un du vilst zogn

00:02:49.977 --> 00:02:53.585
fun dayn lebn, fun dem tsayt funem krig

00:02:53.585 --> 00:02:55.151
nokh dem krig?

00:02:55.326 --> 00:03:00.551
kh'hob dokh aykh gezogt, UNK vos ikh hob aykh gezogt, dos UNK durkhgegan. dos bin ikh durkhgegan.

00:03:03.628 --> 00:03:04.736
un ir i-

00:03:05.468 --> 00:03:07.470
ir hot nisht gornisht mer?

00:03:07.341 --> 00:03:08.347
⟨haynt⟩

00:03:09.231 --> 00:03:10.430
gut.

00:03:20.149 --> 00:03:21.425
ikh meg shoyn zogn?

00:03:22.292 --> 00:03:24.601
vi azoy UNK gekhovet a yesoyme

00:03:24.601 --> 00:03:26.404
bay a feter bay irn.

00:03:26.713 --> 00:03:29.508
zi hot khasene gehat in Ru- in Rusland.

00:03:29.599 --> 00:03:32.161
gekumen iz zi gekumen keyn Shtefanesht.

00:03:32.161 --> 00:03:34.346
in Shtefanesht hot zi khasene gehat.

00:03:34.346 --> 00:03:35.426
dos gedenk ikh.

00:03:35.426 --> 00:03:36.810
a gebrokhn harts

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:39.009
UNK fun dray tekhter.

00:03:40.112 --> 00:03:45.416
zi hot nisht gehat azoy groysn tayneg fun ir zun oykh nisht. er iz geven zeyer a laytisher.

00:03:45.416 --> 00:03:47.683
⟨yeder⟩ hot rakhmones oyf di mame gehat

00:03:47.689 --> 00:03:48.740
ober

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:50.416
s'iz nisht gegangen.

00:03:50.457 --> 00:03:52.850
ot o dos kon ikh epes andersh ⟨nit zogn⟩

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:54.590
keyn andere zakh gedenk ikh ⟨nit⟩

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:55.614
hot oykhet gehat

00:03:55.671 --> 00:03:57.102
a shvester

00:03:57.102 --> 00:03:58.550
take in Shtefanesht

00:03:58.557 --> 00:04:00.325
un gehat a brider UNK

00:04:00.325 --> 00:04:02.212
in Rusland. geblibn dortn.

00:04:02.387 --> 00:04:04.709
epes andersh gornisht fun der babe.

00:04:06.572 --> 00:04:09.590
⟨meyle⟩ UNK ikh kon nisht gedenken di zakhn.
